# llm-draft
msgid "The target list is shorter and the ammunition list is longer. A sound exchange."
msgstr "Целей стало меньше, а расход боезапаса вырос. Обмен честный."

# llm-draft
msgid "The target list said bombers, plural. The pilot read it literally."
